{"name":"Tinsel Beam","hex":"#c3d1d9","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"tinsel","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A shining fabric used for ornamental purposes.\nA silk or wool fabric with gold or silver thread woven into it; brocade.","A silk or wool fabric with gold or silver thread woven into it; brocade."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of fabric: ornamented by being woven with gold or silver thread, or overlaid with thin metal plates; brocaded.","Glittering.\n\n Apparently beautiful and costly but having little value; superficially attractive; gaudy, showy, tawdry."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/tinsel"},{"term":"beam","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any large piece of timber or iron long in proportion to its thickness, and prepared for use.","One of the principal horizontal structural members, usually of steel, timber, or concrete, of a building."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To emit beams of light; to shine; to radiate.","To smile broadly or especially cheerfully."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/beam"}],"entries":[{"title":"Tinsel","blocks":[{"text":"Tinsel is a type of decorative material that mimics the effect of ice. It consists of thin strips of sparkling material attached to a thread. When in long narrow strips not attached to thread, it is called \"lametta\", and emulates icicles. It was originally a metallic garland for Christmas decoration. The modern production of tinsel typically involves plastic, and is used particularly to decorate Christmas trees. It may be hung from ceilings or wrapped around statues and lampposts. Modern tinsel was invented in Nuremberg, Germany, in 1610, and was originally made of shredded silver."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Wraxall_2014_MMB_07_Christmas_Tree.jpg/330px-Wraxall_2014_MMB_07_Christmas_Tree.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tinsel","wikidata":"Q1707568"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Lametta_-_Christmas_decorations.jpg/500px-Lametta_-_Christmas_decorations.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Lametta_-_Christmas_decorations.jpg/500px-Lametta_-_Christmas_decorations.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Original lametta (silver foil with tin and lead)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ALametta_-_Christmas_decorations.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/Weihnachtsbaum_und_Geschenke_1970er.jpg/500px-Weihnachtsbaum_und_Geschenke_1970er.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/Weihnachtsbaum_und_Geschenke_1970er.jpg/500px-Weihnachtsbaum_und_Geschenke_1970er.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A Christmas tree decorated with dangling strands of lametta.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AWeihnachtsbaum_und_Geschenke_1970er.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Skelt%2C_Martin_and_Matthew_-_theatrical_tinsel_portrait_-_Madame_Vestris_as_Apollo_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/500px-Skelt%2C_Martin_and_Matthew_-_theatrical_tinsel_portrait_-_Madame_Vestris_as_Apollo_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Skelt%2C_Martin_and_Matthew_-_theatrical_tinsel_portrait_-_Madame_Vestris_as_Apollo_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/1280px-Skelt%2C_Martin_and_Matthew_-_theatrical_tinsel_portrait_-_Madame_Vestris_as_Apollo_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c7/Skelt%2C_Martin_and_Matthew_-_theatrical_tinsel_portrait_-_Madame_Vestris_as_Apollo_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg/500px-Skelt%2C_Martin_and_Matthew_-_theatrical_tinsel_portrait_-_Madame_Vestris_as_Apollo_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Tinsel print of Madame Vestris as Apollo, English, 1837-40","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASkelt%2C_Martin_and_Matthew_-_theatrical_tinsel_portrait_-_Madame_Vestris_as_Apollo_-_Google_Art_Project.jpg"}],"sounds":{"tinsel":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c7/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-tinsel.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c7/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-tinsel.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-tinsel.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c7/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-tinsel.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-tinsel.wav.ogg"}],"beam":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f2/En-us-beam.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f2/En-us-beam.ogg/En-us-beam.ogg.mp3"}]}}}